    --ink:#111827;
    --muted:#4B5563;
    --paper:#F7F8FA;
    --line:#D5DBE5;
    --teal:#1C8B8E;
    --gold:#B08D2F;
    --warn:#B42318;
    --panel:#FFFFFF;
  }
  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  body{
    margin:0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, "Noto Sans", "Liberation Sans", sans-serif;
  }
  .page{
    width:${W}px;
    height:${H}px;
    padding: 190px 190px 170px 190px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Header */
  header{
    display:flex;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items:flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 26px;
    border-bottom: 10px solid var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }
  .hgroup{ max-width: 78%; }
  h1{
    margin:0;
    font-size: 96px;
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .subtitle{
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--slate);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .venue{
    text-align:right;
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    max-width: 22%;
  }

  /* Layout */
  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 44px;
  }
  .full{ grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .card{
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 2px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 34px 36px;
  }
  .section-title{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .section-title h2{
    margin:0;
    font-size: 52px;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .section-title .objective{
    margin:0;
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align:right;
  }

  /* Anchor block */
  .anchor{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 34px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .anchor .big{
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(11,31,59,1) 0%, rgba(28,139,142,1) 100%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 34px 34px 28px 34px;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .anchor .big:before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:-60px;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), rgba(255,255,255,0) 60%);
    transform: translate(40px, -10px);
  }
  .anchor .big *{ position: relative; }
  .anchor .kicker{
    font-size: 34px;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 800;
    opacity: 0.95;
  }
  .anchor .stat{
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 230px;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .anchor .explain{
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 38px;
    line-height: 1.22;
    font-weight: 600;
    max-width: 980px;
  }

  .risk-col{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .risk{
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 26px 26px;
    border: 2px solid var(--line);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .risk .label{
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .risk .value{
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 86px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
  }
  .risk .note{
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .risk.warn{
    border-color: rgba(180,35,24,0.35);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(180,35,24,0.06), rgba(180,35,24,0.0));
  }
  .risk.warn .value{ color: var(--warn); }
  .risk.good{
    border-color: rgba(28,139,142,0.35);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(28,139,142,0.08), rgba(28,139,142,0.0));
  }
  .risk.good .value{ color: var(--teal); }

  /* Performance bars */
  .bars{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .barRow{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 520px 1fr 170px;
    align-items:center;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .barLabel{
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--slate);
  }
  .barTrack{
    height: 34px;
    background: #EEF2F7;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid #E3E8F2;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .barFill{
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .barFill.ai{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(28,139,142,1), rgba(28,139,142,0.78)); }
  .barFill.clin{ background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(11,31,59,1), rgba(11,31,59,0.78)); }
  .barValue{
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align:right;
  }
  .delta{
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(176,141,47,0.35);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(176,141,47,0.12), rgba(176,141,47,0.0));
    display:flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .delta .dnum{
    font-size: 82px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 950;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    min-width: 230px;
  }
  .delta .dtext{
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--slate);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.28;
  }

  /* Table */
  table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  thead th{
    text-align:left;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 850;
    padding: 16px 14px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  tbody td{
    font-size: 30px;
    padding: 16px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E6EAF2;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  tbody tr:last-child td{ border-bottom: none; }
  .num{ text-align:right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  /* Bullets */
  ul{
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 28px;
  }
  li{
    margin: 10px 0;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.32;
    color: var(--slate);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Footer */
  footer{
    position:absolute;
    left: 190px;
    right: 190px;
    bottom: 90px;
    padding-top: 26px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .tag{
    display:inline-block;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid #D7DEE9;
    background: #FAFBFD;
    color: var(--slate);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="hgroup">
        <h1>${escapeHtml(title)}</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">${escapeHtml(oneLiner)}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="venue">${escapeHtml(venue)}</div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card full">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Key Finding</h2>
          <p class="objective">Implementation gap dominates clinical readiness</p>
        </div>
        <div class="anchor">
          <div class="big">
            <div class="kicker">Prospective validation among published models</div>
            <div class="stat">${escapeHtml(anchor)}</div>
            <div class="explain">Fewer than five in one hundred published AI models ever reach prospective clinical validation — the primary barrier between research performance and bedside deployment.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="risk-col">
            <div class="risk warn">
              <div class="label">Studies reporting demographic bias assessment</div>
              <div class="value">${escapeHtml(biasRate)}</div>
              <div class="note">Bias auditing remains rare, limiting confidence in safety and equity across patient subgroups.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="risk good">
              <div class="label">Average reduction in diagnostic turnaround time (AI-assisted)</div>
              <div class="value">${escapeHtml(tta)}</div>
              <div class="note">Time gains can matter in emergency and time-sensitive settings when integrated safely.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Background &amp; Motivation</h2>
          <p class="objective">Why this evidence matters</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>AI-based clinical decision support is expanding rapidly across diagnostic, prognostic, and therapeutic domains.</li>
          <li>Controlled research settings show strong performance, but real-world translation is limited by validation, workflow, and governance gaps.</li>
          <li>Clinician trust and regulatory readiness depend on transparency, prospective evaluation, and subgroup reporting.</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="margin-top:24px; display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span class="tag">Evidence synthesis (2023)</span>
          <span class="tag">Clinical CDSS</span>
          <span class="tag">Safety &amp; equity</span>
          <span class="tag">Implementation science</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Diagnostic Performance</h2>
          <p class="objective">AI vs clinician-only workflows</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bars" aria-label="Sensitivity comparison">
          <div class="barRow">
            <div class="barLabel">AI sensitivity (median)</div>
            <div class="barTrack"><div class="barFill ai" style="width:${(aiW*100).toFixed(1)}%"></div></div>
            <div class="barValue">${escapeHtml(aiSens)}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="barRow">
            <div class="barLabel">Clinician-only sensitivity (median)</div>
            <div class="barTrack"><div class="barFill clin" style="width:${(clinW*100).toFixed(1)}%"></div></div>
            <div class="barValue">${escapeHtml(clinSens)}</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="delta">
          <div class="dnum">+${(aiSensNum - clinSensNum).toFixed(1)} pp</div>
          <div class="dtext">Median sensitivity improvement for AI systems across &gt;400 diagnostic studies. Specificity gains are smaller (AI 93.1% vs clinicians 91.4%).</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:26px; font-size:30px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:700;">Domain-level performance (selected):</div>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Domain</th>
              <th class="num">AI Sens.</th>
              <th class="num">Clin. Sens.</th>
              <th class="num">AI Spec.</th>
              <th class="num">Clin. Spec.</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            ${wrapRows(perfRows)}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Safety, Bias, and Health Equity</h2>
          <p class="objective">Where risk concentrates</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Only ${escapeHtml(biasRate)} of studies report a formal demographic bias assessment (age, sex, ethnicity, socioeconomic status).</li>
          <li>Among audited studies, sensitivity disparities of 5–12 percentage points are reported for underrepresented populations in some settings.</li>
          <li>Adverse safety events are rarely reported in prospective trials (&lt;1%), but under-reporting is suspected without standardised frameworks.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Implementation Gap</h2>
          <p class="objective">From papers to practice</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong style="color:var(--navy)">${escapeHtml(fda)}</strong> AI/ML-enabled medical devices had U.S. FDA clearance (as of 2023), yet published models rarely reach prospective validation.</li>
          <li>Barriers: fragmented data infrastructure, evolving regulation, clinician trust and explainability, limited economic evidence, and workflow misalignment.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="card full">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Recommendations &amp; Future Directions</h2>
          <p class="objective">Actions to close the gap</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px;">
          <ul>
            <li>Mandate prospective, multi-site validation before routine deployment.</li>
            <li>Standardise bias auditing and demographic-stratified reporting as publication requirements.</li>
            <li>Establish safety-reporting registries analogous to pharmacovigilance for AI-CDSS.</li>
          </ul>
          <ul>
            <li>Invest in interoperability (FHIR, OMOP) and reproducible evaluation pipelines.</li>
            <li>Prioritise explainability and human factors to strengthen clinician trust and adoption.</li>
            <li>Generate cost-effectiveness evidence aligned to health-system decision-making.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div><span class="tag">Key takeaway</span> AI can improve diagnostic sensitivity, but safety and implementation evidence lags.</div>
      <div>Source: synthesis of evidence summarised in <em>The Lancet Digital Health</em> (2023).</div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>`;

